{"id":"ovl3lgw6yz7o5drb7brbzavd1","title":"组成论一书的序言（再版）","originalTitle":null,"summary":"张学文在气象台工作多年后，通过自学统计学和信息论，提出了将信息熵应用于气象预报的新方法。1981年，他出版了《气象预告问题的信息分析》，1992年又出版了《熵气象学》。1997年，他提出了广义集合模型，进一步发展了“组成论”这一概念，旨在提供一种概括客观事物并寻找理论说明的新方法。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=2024&do=blog&id=1560659"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T04:07:32.890Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T04:07:32.890Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["论文发表"],"score":26,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}